cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reuse or cite KORS, please credit its origin as follows."
title: "KORS, Kernel for Operations and Resources System: Specification"
abstract: >-
  KORS names an architecture property of production management applications
  (MES, QMS, CMMS, DMS, PLM and other ISA-95 Level 3 applications). A system is
  KORS if it satisfies five criteria: event-based communication, a common
  vocabulary at the boundaries, autonomy of each service, modular adoption and
  open data.
